{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36431","headline":"春望梁石头城 · 罗邺","name":"春望梁石头城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳碧桑黄破国春，残阳微雨望归人。\n江山不改兴亡地，冠盖自爲前後尘。\n帆势挂风轻若翅，浪声吹岸叠如鳞。\n六朝无限悲愁事，欲下荒城回首频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36431.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36431","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}